// What the model gives, written by `BLESS=1` (design/19-cases.md).
run: every order
outcome 1
  refused
  value `&mut a`: none
  value `&mut b`: none
  value 1u8: u8
  value 2u16: u16
  value A: none
  value B: none
  value R: none
  value S1: u8
  value S2: u16
  value `Some(1u8)`: Option<u8>
  value `Some(2u16)`: Option<u16>
  decision `lend a`: lend &mut place
  decision `lend b`: lend &mut place
  partition {A, B}
  check `1u8 <= S1`: Ok(Identity)
  check `2u16 <= S2`: Ok(Identity)
  refusal no_join `A.Payload(Some)`
  refusal no_value `&mut a`
  refusal no_value `&mut b`
  refusal no_value A
  refusal no_value R
  I* of a final state: []
